{"text": "Eckels looked around the room carefully. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everything looked the same, except the big sign on the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The sign now said, NAIM ANY YEER EN THE PAST, WEE TAEK YU THAIR. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Eckels was confused. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, he saw the TV. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The new president was on the news, but it was not Mister Keith. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What is going on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He got more confused. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He sat down and looked closely at the mud on his shoes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> No, it cannot be, said Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is all because of this little thing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was shocked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the mud on his right shoe, he found a small dead butterfly.", "alignment": {"characters": ["E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", " ", "c", "a", "r", "e", "f", "u", "l", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "v", "e", "r", "y", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", ",", " ", "e", "x", "c", "e", "p", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "s", "i", "g", "n", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "s", "i", "g", "n", " ", "n", "o", "w", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "N", "A", "I", "M", " ", "A", "N", "Y", " ", "Y", "E", "E", "R", " ", "E", "N", " ", "T", "H", "E", " ", "P", "A", "S", "T", ",", " ", "W", "E", "E", " ", "T", "A", "E", "K", " ", "Y", "U", " ", "T", "H", "A", "I", "R", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", "